phone.description:
⚠️ **This channel can only read vehicle status — it cannot control the car.** The gateway rejects every command interface for this token generation (`079001`), for the owner account as well. To control the car, go back and pick "GRIC token" instead.

Enter the phone number registered with the Zeekr app. An SMS verification code will be sent to it.
